  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. The item repro rtl/a.v emits only module a plus the file node, with no task/function/net symbols. test_stable_id_floor_gate.py:1542 still lists verilog in FLAT_LANGUAGES ('only modules and interfaces are emitted'). MECHANISM: verilog extraction stops at module/interface declarations."  # b66f
